---
/** Bottom of /tonight/ and /this-weekend/: the attribution and caveat notes that must sit next to the data (OpenStreetMap, area names, drive
 *  times) and one line of sources. The "what this shows / how to use it" text lives on /how-we-gather-this/ (lib/page-explainers.ts), not in
 *  a box on the page (owner 2026-11-07). */
---
<div id="about-this-page" class="ev-about">
  <p class="ev-note"><slot name="sources" /></p>
  <slot />
</div>
<style is:global>
  .ev-about { margin: 2rem 0 0; }
  .ev-about p.ev-note { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.9375rem; max-width: 44rem; }
</style>
